        "text": "Good afternoon, everyone, and welcome to the mini conference of Block 2. My name is Sofia, and I am your moderator today. Our panel has three speakers, and each one has a time slot of three minutes. After the three talks, we will have fifteen minutes for questions. Our topic this afternoon is trust in football: how clubs, sponsors and federations build it, and how they lose it. Our first panelist works in sports marketing in Madrid. Our second panelist is Doctor Nilo Patussi, chief compliance officer at a major Brazilian club. And our third panelist is a sports journalist from Mexico City. Please keep your phones on silent, and write down your questions as you listen. What I want you to remember is that there are no bad questions today. So, let's start."
